  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Mozambique - Projet de t&#xe9;l&#xe9;communication</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mozambique - Telecommunication Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Le projet propos&#xe9; consiste principalement en la construction d&apos;une station de troposculture compl&#xe8;te &#xe0; Massinga, qui servira de relais entre Namaacha et Chiluvo. Les travaux de construction comprendront &#xe9;galement l&apos;installation d&apos;antennes r&#xe9;fl&#xe9;chissantes &#xe0; Chiluvo et &#xe0; Namaacha, face &#xe0; Massinga. Une fois le projet achev&#xe9;, les t&#xe9;l&#xe9;communications entre Maputo et Beira seront r&#xe9;tablies le long d&apos;un axe Maputo-Namaacha-Massinga-Chiluvo-Beira.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project consists mainly of the constructin of a complete back-to-back troposcatter station in Massinga which will serve as a relay station between Namaacha and Chiluvo. The construction works will also include the installation of reflecting antennas in Chiluvo and Namaacha, facing Massinga. when completed, telecommunication between Maputo and Beira will be re-established along an axis consisting of Maputo-Namaacha-Massinga-Chiluvo-Beira.</narrative>
  </description>
